# 4. Google App Password & Email Notifications (Club Meetings, Announcements, Password Resets)
# How to get a Google App Password:
# 1. Go to your Google Account (myaccount.google.com) -> Security.
# 2. Ensure 2-Step Verification is turned ON.
# 3. Search for "App Passwords" or go to: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 4. Create a new App Password (e.g. named "ClubSync"). Google will generate a 16-letter password (e.g. 'abcd efgh ijkl mnop').
# 5. Paste the email address and 16-character password below:
GMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your-16-character-app-password
EMAIL_SENDER_NAME="ClubSync Multi-Campus Platform"

